Hermes Agent
https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent
Release: v2026.9.7

Melete's runtime image installs Hermes from the release above at build time.
Hermes is not vendored into this repository.

Melete modifies the installed Hermes source at that point. The runtime image,
and the process supervisor used for local development, apply Melete's lifecycle
observer bridge (packages/runtime-hermes/patches/observer_bridge.py) to the
installed tree. It adds a compaction dispatch and binds Melete's plugin
observations to the current HTTP run queue; it changes no upstream decision, and
it refuses to apply unless the three source sections it edits match the reviewed
release. See packages/runtime-hermes/README.md.

